  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往炼金之馆2楼与炼金师（70.23）对话，交出【证明信】获得【神圣的宝石】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆炼金之馆抵达方式参考《拜访炼金之馆》任务",
      "type": "route-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.前往伊尔村港湾管理处，持有【战舰乘坐信】与战舰舰长（19.11）对话，传送至荒岛探险团营地。",
      "type": "held-item-teleport",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆【战舰乘坐信】获得方式参考《蔓延的邪恶》任务",
      "type": "item-source",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "3.与炼金师队长（49.54）对话，获得【重要通行证】。",
      "type": "item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "4.与营地守卫（64.28）对话，传送至无名神殿。通过（144.93）处楼梯进入神殿暗道。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "◆神殿暗道为随机迷宫，约5层；魔物为Lv.64~68毒蜘蛛（土蜘蛛）、无名的亡者（僵尸）、狂暴软泥怪（布丁史莱姆）",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "5.通过随机迷宫抵达无名神殿，与大祭祀之灵（98.60）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "Lv.75大祭祀之灵，血量约12000；技能：攻击、防御、吸血魔法、超强石化魔法、攻击反弹",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "Lv.75血护卫（血骷髅）*4，血量约4500；技能：攻击、防御、攻击反弹、乾坤一掷",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "6.战斗胜利后调查水晶球（98.49），交出【神圣的宝石】获得【净化之尘】并传送至无名的神殿。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "7.返回荒岛探险团营地与炼金师队（49.54）长对话，交出【净化之尘】、【重要通行证】获得【定位宝石】。",
      "type": "combined-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "8.与高级炼金师（48.53）对话，选“是”传送至无名神殿。通过（35.83）处楼梯进入神殿暗道。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "◆神殿暗道为随机迷宫，约7层；魔物为Lv.69~73追猎者（地狱看门犬）、游荡者（小石像怪）",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "9.通过随机迷宫抵达无名神殿，与时空之影（98.60）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "Lv.75时空之影，血量约14000；技能：攻击、防御、四属性强力攻击魔法",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "Lv.75时空守卫*2，血量约7000；技能：攻击、防御、诸刃、攻击反弹",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "10.战斗胜利后调查水晶球（98.49），交出【定位宝石】获得【记忆水晶】并传送回无名神殿。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "11.前往炼金之馆2楼与管理官（82.10）对话，交出【记忆水晶】获得【炼金大师徽章】、【领取证明】。",
      "type": "combined-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "◆【炼金大师徽章】：Lv.5护身符、耐久150；生命+150、魔力+150、魅力+5；不可交易、丢地消失",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "◆持有【炼金大师徽章】可进入荒岛探险团营地、炼金之馆、幻境森林",
      "type": "access-effect",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "◆【战舰乘坐信】、【境界宝石】、【会员徽章】可丢弃",
      "type": "obsolete-item-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "12.前往炼金之馆1楼与守卫者（27.19）对话，进入房间。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "13.与炼金兽合成大师（22.74）对话，选“是”交出【领取证明】获得Lv.1幼生独角兽，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "◆持有【幻想碎片】*50与炼金兽合成大师（16.70）对话，可兑换Lv.1幼生独角兽",
      "type": "alternate-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
